  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "fc87931c-7131-4932-848d-954ae5d7fbc7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Applied On Single Value**\n",
    "\n",
    "16 --- 10000(B.Value)\n",
    "\n",
    "~16 -- Means Flipping **0 as 1** , **1 as 0**\n",
    "\n",
    "10000 as 01111 --> (15)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9fa3bd09-1ad1-4842-ad39-b9062e698dcc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "To Short this..\n",
    "\n",
    "**Formula** :  **~x = -(x+1)**\n",
    "\n",
    "n = 16 , -23\n",
    "    \n",
    "~16 = -(16+1) = -17\n",
    "\n",
    "~-23 = -(-23+1) = -(-22) = 22\n",
    "    "
   ]
  },
